          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Benjamin Moore Waterborne Ceiling Paint is the choice for most ceilings when you want an even finish that disappears, and Sherwin-Williams Eminence is the one for patched or uneven surfaces. BEHR Premium Plus is the value buy for whole-house repaints, KILZ Color Change takes the guesswork out of white over white, Zinsser Perma-White handles bathrooms, Glidden covers budget spaces, and KILZ PVA primer goes under every new drywall ceiling.
          </p>
